{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dd3f88c372973bae28e35b182355da7c8fa21e67f0fc4f0967329ef01e7a0814", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのアイドルをスカウトに来たは\nいいけど、なかなかいい感じの子が……）", "zh": "（出来寻找39PROJECT的偶像，\n却一直没看到适合的女孩……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e9457eed1fbc71c12dae9fbb213efe9b51cc71795be360aef986f72ef6cfec05", "ja": "（ん！？　あの子、ものすごい美人じゃないか！\nこれは声をかけるしかない！）", "zh": "（嗯！？那女生长得好漂亮！\n一定要去问问看！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c995381d2f7bc5891e36c53b66187795daab9da52846bf9d60fe032397397a58", "ja": "あの、すみません！\nアイドルに興味ありませんか？", "zh": "不好意思，打扰一下！\n请问你有没有兴趣当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "35ada8448224dd49b8879e7e2417284bac7c678bb98747b1a8d26d5b1c42c202", "ja": "……っ！　え？　え、っと……。", "zh": "……！咦？呃、呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9926bef5b7b7f1e6b72c169f952730aae837e27afc55c59c6925212242bbec3c", "ja": "実は俺、アイドルのプロデューサーを\nしてまして、ぜひあなたをスカウトしたいと……。", "zh": "是这样的，其实我是偶像制作人，\n希望邀请你来当偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a2154b3573d4eec3366e1b9fbb8c220220f30364310f2957594a1a938673d381", "ja": "あ、これ名刺です！\nこの通り、決して怪しい者ではありませんから！", "zh": "啊，这是我的名片！\n如你所见，我绝对不是什么可疑人物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "3b522142c883f4bb0282b940de53f7916a3aa6dd432a549387e6f5435477c4ac", "ja": "765プロダクション、プロデューサー……\nあ、ほ、ホントだ……。", "zh": "765艺能事务所的制作人……\n啊，是、是真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "d5e3ff7c2dc208b437d11b1d392588baf5e87f731e587419276e7e27ec99cd5e", "ja": "えっ……あ、アイドル！？\nわ……わた、私が……ですか？", "zh": "等等……偶、偶像！？\n你……你、你说……我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2d5f25886173d9a45672fe1df057ca91203062ff28702603350de3cefe0cec66", "ja": "はい。遠くからでも目を引く佇まい、際立つ華やかさ\n……アイドルにとって、大事な要素です！", "zh": "没错，你华丽出众的外表远远地就吸引住我的目光……\n这对偶像来说是很重要的特质！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "87b88cdc921200d84b5397f3bdbae900192a942c3965fddd1ff9ceb9651394e4", "ja": "そ、そんな……無理、です……。\n私、ひ、人前に出るなんて……。", "zh": "不、不行……我，办不到……\n我，不、不可能在大众面前表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "698b4c601cccaeb6248c2374da0ab1fd7ff81b2f7f8104f10c18b1f286777ce9", "ja": "なら、せめて名刺だけでも受け取ってください。\nもし興味がわいたら連絡をもらえませんか？", "zh": "不然，这张名片还是请你留着吧。\n要是你有了兴趣，可以再联络我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "4366a23bc38f8d6b40ea6ea294ecada41b4c451c5489048bb34934ba88d71bcd", "ja": "は、はい……。\nえっと、その…………し、失礼します！", "zh": "好、好的……\n呃，那个…………我、我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1013_null", "source_sha256": "c40d0ef2d3b97fbc63e09f651876831f31aaa5250e9268ac7d3ee71d2e5aecde", "ja": "そして、1ヶ月後……", "zh": "然后，过了一个月……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "65ce10673ae18387850a12b0b1612b662570bf4c96321efb97b2610a2d6d4578", "ja": "（つい、また足を運んでしまったけど……\n何度来ても、やっぱりあの綺麗な子はいないか）", "zh": "（又不知不觉跑来这里了……\n但不管来几次，还是没看到那个漂亮的女生。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c13e9ab03c944a9d44392b0ff04d32fc390e70feb13291c206937538afb4caaf", "ja": "（華やかな見た目と違って、案外気弱そうな\n感じの子だったからな。もう連絡は……）", "zh": "（她的外表华丽，个性却意外地很畏缩。\n我看应该不会有消息了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "f2234e816654ce738f969457c3682bc05bced04cfba279c190229a2bdcbea65c", "ja": "……あ……あ、あの……。\n765プロの方、ですか……？", "zh": "……不……不、不好意思……\n请问你是765艺能、的制作人吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "686ea922e8f8fdca1f8492f0d820320e13fc7a50ef115f3dfddb73c450afb64f", "ja": "え……？　あっ、この間の！", "zh": "咦……？你是之前那女孩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "70d182f7c05c6801b7d27023624b9f58da7944399ec7f7d3d039879fd1ef74d2", "ja": "せ、先日は、失礼しました……。\n私……し、篠宮、可憐といいます……。", "zh": "上、上次，很抱歉……\n我叫做……筿、筿宫，可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "aceacc7bfe6683c684d38bebc954578f69432b9fe195829bc508928cb083e94e", "ja": "そ、その……わ、私が、アイドルに、というお話……\nす、少し、考えてみました……。", "zh": "那、那个……关、关于要我当偶像，那件事情……\n我、我花了点时间，考虑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "7d199cb305af90d8d75d601a3ca96676b13f986a9a2d38b2c181c67822fe828c", "ja": "それで、き、気がついたら、1ヶ月も……\nたってしまって……", "zh": "想不到，一、一转眼，就过了……\n一个月……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2d53fee9a8a7ac87277485379a4ae6805351cf95bb5133b65a0e2df7b33f39d1", "ja": "そ、そうですね。それで……？", "zh": "是、是啊。那么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "06bfbf7a79a6c09c3d7cf45a19216d3ab67e7a6d2cb4b639007cb33cbd416568", "ja": "わ、私が、アイドルとして、ステージに立つなんて\n……そ、想像しただけで、気絶しそうですけど……。", "zh": "要、要我，当偶像，上舞台表演……\n我、我光在脑袋想像，就快要昏倒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "8228c0cb54376af996243910daae072f1cf33cc67f0271667be51e9cf82f76af", "ja": "でも、私……か、変えたいと、思ってるんです。\n……こんなふうに、臆病な……じ、自分を……。", "zh": "不过，我……想、想要做出改变。\n……我想要改变，如此胆小的……自、自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "7349ece1dacbf8b478ef3f1ba21847040cbc707b5970a1b644910552ff32b1a2", "ja": "だから……こ、これが、そのきっかけに、\nなったらって……私……。", "zh": "所以……我、我认为，这应该能够、\n成为一个……契机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "179b14353fd98b45fe9b33e93ec0f70770c5819c8d046566ea76f14fa1040e5e", "ja": "あ、あの……こんな、り、理由でも……\nアイドルに、なれますか……？", "zh": "请、请问……这样的，理、理由……\n也能够，成为偶像吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_1026", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "dfe3b0c2979a135a803f929893761467385cd69a50f41abafbf6dc807261cba5", "ja": "……もちろん。俺が必ず、君を輝かせてみせる！\nこれからよろしく！", "zh": "……当然可以，我一定会让你绽放光芒！\n以后也请多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_2001_045kar", "source_sha256": "748acf9df5a81293a93c5c5681d5cba952f4f0a13100929eff7caa8111a2f8f2", "ja": "は、はいっ！\n……よ、よろしく、お願いします……！", "zh": "是、是的！\n……请、请多多，指教……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_045kar_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_045kar_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "0a6510e2f6d2b07377d148cbd754383ebb666de3cb6fd0e91d62a1425c3e0e43", "ja": "（変わりたいっていう願い……叶えるためにも、\nしっかりとプロデュースしていこう！）", "zh": "（她希望改变自己……为了实现她的愿望，\n我要好好地培育她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
